  "description": "With VIVI Electric Tricycle, you gain the freedom to explore every corner within 10 miles of home-no more limits on grocery runs, neighborhood errands, casual rides, or spontaneous adventures. Designed with an extra-wide rider seat and a newly added rear passenger seat—complete with a safety belt. Now you can share the journey with family or friends and reconnect with nature in total comfort. Powered by a 750W motor power, it reaches top speeds of 15.5 mph, while the 864Wh removable battery provides a reliable 50-60 miles range for your daily adventures.\n\n1500W peak powerful rear drive motor, 80Nm torque\nRemovable 48V 18Ah 864Wh lithium-ion battery\nSpeed differential mechanism and Parking brake\nIntelligent 5 level pedal assist and Digital LCD display\nWide and thick saddle with shock absorption system\nBright headlight and rear reflector light\nAmple storage space & high load capacity\nwalking assist mode are more suitable for women & elder\n\nSGS certified to UL2849 & UL2271 safety standards",
